[I] An MPEG-4 AAC decoder

[T] The FAAD project includes the AAC decoder FAAD2. It supports several
[T] MPEG-4 object types (LC, Main, LTP, HE AAC, PS) and file formats (ADTS
[T] AAC, raw AAC, MP4), multichannel and gapless decoding as well as MP4
[T] metadata tags. The codecs are compatible with standard-compliant audio
[T] applications using one or more of these profiles.

